>> Animal := Mea fou.
>> Factory := Mea fou.

Animal pe-a-oo-mai: ['fou'] fai: {
	>> animal := ia-lava fou.
	animal sound: ['?']. <- animal.
}.

Animal pe-a-oo-mai: ['sound:'] fai: { :s
	lana-lava sound := s.
}.

Animal pe-a-oo-mai: ['sound'] fai: { <- lana-lava sound.
}.

>> Dog := Mea fou.
>> Cat := Mea fou.

Dog pe-a-oo-mai: ['fou'] fai: { <- Animal fou sound: ['woof!'].
}.

Cat pe-a-oo-mai: ['fou'] fai: { <- Animal fou sound: ['meow!'].
}.

Tuuina-atu tusi: Dog fou sound, laina-fou.
Tuuina-atu tusi: Cat fou sound, laina-fou.

Factory pe-a-oo-mai: ['mix:and:'] fai: { :beast1 :beast2 <- Animal fou sound: (
		( beast1 sound amata: 0 umi: 2 ) +
		( beast2 sound amata: 2 umi: 5 )
	).
}.

Tuuina-atu tusi: (Factory mix: Dog fou and: Cat fou) sound, laina-fou.
